<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Fourth Round:</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Sabine Appelmans 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 6-0</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
